comments.body:
@Kaivish I have just got my pull-request accepted. Next nightly will contain a status page to see when the data is pulled, how old the readings were etc. 

I am looking further into this issue and will probably add more pull requests to further improve this feature. The tradeoffs are data and cpu usage vs bd delay.

xdrip wakes up about 5 minutes after the previuos reading. the challenge is that the data is arriving late to Nightscout which has a default poll rate of 2.5 minutes without looking at the bg time. Looking into improving that too.

@Kaivish Are you still experiencing this problem?
If not, can we close the issue?
Thanks
